  "date": "2026-11-02",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "五部门发文，城乡商品市场要推广电子结算和无感支付",
  "title_en": "Five departments issue guideline: urban and rural commodity markets to promote e-settlement and frictionless payment",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月30日，国家发展改革委和另外四个部门一起发了一份文件。这四个部门是商务部、交通运输部、市场监管总局，还有文化和旅游部。",
      "en": "On October 30, the National Development and Reform Commission and four other departments jointly issued a document. The four departments are the Ministry of Commerce, the Ministry of Transport, the State Administration for Market Regulation, and the Ministry of Culture and Tourism."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这份文件讲的是消费基础设施的建设，希望消费和投资能互相带动。",
      "en": "The document is about building consumption infrastructure, and it hopes that consumption and investment can drive each other."
    },
    {
      "zh": "文件里有一部分是关于城市和农村的商品交易市场。文件说，这些市场要用上更多数字化的办法，例如无感支付、电子结算，还有智能称重和溯源管理。",
      "en": "One part of the document is about commodity trading markets in cities and the countryside. It says these markets should use more digital methods, such as frictionless payment and e-settlement, as well as smart weighing and traceability management."
    },
    {
      "zh": "无感支付是顾客不用扫码，系统就能自动收款的付款方式。电子结算是用电子的方式算账和付款。文件希望这些市场把线上和线下结合起来，变成现代化的市场。",
      "en": "Frictionless payment is a way of paying where the customer does not need to scan a code and the system collects the money automatically. E-settlement means calculating accounts and making payments electronically. The document hopes these markets will combine online and offline and become modern markets."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "移动支付网",
    "name_en": "Mpaypass (China Mobile Payment Network)",
    "url": "https://www.mpaypass.com.cn/news/202610/30183959.html"
  },
